      "works_on": ["ingredient/onion"],
      "with": ["ingredient/butter", "ingredient/red-pepper-paste"],
      "text": "Melt the butter in a pan over a gentle heat and soften the onion without letting it colour. Stir in the red pepper paste and fry it just until it darkens and smells sweet. Do not let it scorch.",
