      "with": ["ingredient/onion", "ingredient/red-pepper-paste", "ingredient/butter", "ingredient/water"],
      "text": "Stir the onion and paste into the beans with a ladle of their liquid. Simmer gently with the lid ajar, topping up with hot water if the beans show above the liquid, until the beans are very tender and the liquid is thick, red and glossy. Check a bean from the middle against a trusted guide to doneness.",
      "time": {"from": 30, "to": 40, "unit": "minute"},
